OL,7,G2250 Can We Cure Dementia? Tonight
OL,8,     FDementia is now Britain's biggest
OL,9,     Fkiller. Unlike cancer, treatments
OL,10,     Fhave changed little in decades -
OL,11,     Funtil now. With two new drugs now
OL,12,     Fproven to slow the disease - and
OL,13,     Fanother 158 currently being tested
OL,14,     F- Paul Brand follows one of the
OL,15,     Fmost anticipated medical trials,
OL,16,     Fmeeting patients and scientists
OL,17,     Fhoping to be part of a
OL,18,     Fbreakthrough
